        # The SKIP protocol: a contract that could not RUN on this host is a named
        # warning, never an error, so a machine-local environment gap is not
        # enqueued as a harness flaw the other machine can never reproduce.
        # Drives the real run_behavioral_contract/contract_issue plus the real
